{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1000_p", "source_sha256": "234b5b9860fb8507b4eb52d0e4cc91d0dea5df2c2c1e4e9d437527c7224ae95b", "ja": "（占い師をモチーフにした、可憐の衣装が届いた。\nさて、フィッティングの具合は……）", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1001_045kar", "source_sha256": "6f52c243d4dcae51b52ba4d120441ba22f81707d8607e52ded5d767e536734f8", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\nあの……、ど、どうでしょうか？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ac699f16d8a4ec477420825c9c0c77e5857be0ffd2b8646e0d572eb5a11dc361", "ja": "すごくいい！　衣装のミステリアスな雰囲気が\n可憐によく合ってると思う。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1003_045kar", "source_sha256": "64ba9262793c4b0f66c528de826405a6c1f64436d81dd8058ade94d902eb8ec1", "ja": "本当ですか？　少し地味かもって思いましたけど……\nそう言ってもらえて、よ、よかったです……えへへ♪", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1004_p", "source_sha256": "70ffbdaed576504d02913f79e570852e21aa80a178cbb64df485495d559da151", "ja": "実際に着ると雰囲気が出るな。何か小物を持ったら……\nあれ？　机にあるのは、占いの本か？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1005_045kar", "source_sha256": "72f18520f77a36e12fe4ef2cbe1c88a45bb73619eda60177c6cc6a44d9624694", "ja": "え？　あ、それは……私の、です……。占い師の役を\nやるので……ちょっと、勉強してみようかと……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "88b232a17cf28704520872092b6e1a003afe68c8813c5595e781020531f6c422", "ja": "それに……前から、気になっていて……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1007_p", "source_sha256": "5bf873c7a6411767f70347d8cc88dd24ebcdc03996032a923aab5171744722d2", "ja": "気になってるって、占いを？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1008_045kar", "source_sha256": "baf0b77a52fdcba4e62ca7cc472b6e1f68c3543c90e45740696992b3dfa46165", "ja": "はい……。占いって、答えを教えてもらうというより\nま、迷ってる時や、不安な時に……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1009_045kar", "source_sha256": "d0aaf4d666022f676853115e4327c1fc4ee8984b2e1b9da93a7cc905c2ff80af", "ja": "前を向くきっかけ、なのかもしれないって……。\nずっと、素敵だなぁって思ってたんです……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1010_p", "source_sha256": "9cae02aafc0404cce5b905c35268679207e753e384c54b800d5a6ca8dc6405a0", "ja": "なるほど。確かに、占う人によって解釈は違うし。\n背中を押してもらうって感覚だよな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1011_045kar", "source_sha256": "5b60a8f0da569f0df3fc18b41d6468624c21a7d9cbcd26a52a22b9a88d740645", "ja": "は、はい。前に、お仕事の悩みを\nあずささんに相談した時……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1012_045kar", "source_sha256": "3033bb178325883b1586089a981781c4abc2e6e642b3b38b80c38ffdf6ae6cde", "ja": "占いで、アドバイスをもらって……\nすごく、気持ちが楽になったことがあったんです……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1013_p", "source_sha256": "98e89c328a0443ec2a4c94b4667ffabc6784c91dd3c0f4f2166664dea2dded33", "ja": "だから気になってたのか。\nじゃあ、今回の仕事は、いいきっかけになったんだな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1014_045kar", "source_sha256": "39f176c3f966f04a57d080d02734f1097d9e3089f4169ea60528f34bd0a8d7d7", "ja": "ち、ちゃんとできるのか、不安もありますけど……。\nでも、せっかくの機会ですし……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1015_045kar", "source_sha256": "c7cf7a2dc14ce10b0528c171a53660561a7ad6f6816fe12127de8376d46058af", "ja": "や、役作りだけで終わらせるのは、勿体ないですから\n……。でも、あずささんに比べたら、まだまだで……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0d516c9c3abad4f659335580ea3c1394f76b412286cf6c1bf641da960000c136", "ja": "まだまだでいいんじゃないか？　最初から上手に\nできる人はいないし……ぜひ、続けてみるといいよ。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1017_p", "source_sha256": "2fd1c7fc7a964c7d22cf21e13b4cc9b90a9ea0d09a0181dd20dd6ccdf96d5cfd", "ja": "それに、ちょっと興味があるな。可憐の占い。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1018_045kar", "source_sha256": "14be48d57d628ebd9c364a79c386a5a8927c44365ed1f3219ce8a3d5454bd49d", "ja": "えっ……？　{$P$}さんも、\n占ってほしいお悩みとか、あるんですか……？", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1019_p", "source_sha256": "7ea8b01c1086afd950443baca4125a523856ff224f146ce692b9e5e57a742d2f", "ja": "もちろん！　仕事運とか、まあいろいろと……。\nだから、いつか可憐に占ってもらえたら心強いな。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1020_045kar", "source_sha256": "074b1fed90afce38c584322e3fbf4a9859879231753bcece87867be5956968eb", "ja": "わ、わかりました。{$P$}さんには、\nいつも背中を押してもらってますから……。", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_045kar0624_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_045kar0624_1021_045kar", "source_sha256": "2869e4dde00a2d21065a4e6a83db50e4f0474c9437f725bc22ea5e198c8ffba4", "ja": "今度は、私が背中を押してあげられるように……。\nが、がんばって、勉強してみます……！", "zh": "", "status": "untranslated", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
